6ab.webm?t=1603491947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295420/extras/23d5f7f881b08e5c4a97f18603cac6ab.mp4?t=1603491947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>There are also unique player character appearances to unlock with your game progress.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295420/extras/fe9687bef22174acb8110da774427147.poster.avif?t=1603491947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295420/extras/fe9687bef22174acb8110da774427147.webm?t=1603491947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295420/extras/fe9687bef22174acb8110da774427147.mp4?t=1603491947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
